          "name": "fall reports",
          "value": "30",
          "unit": "fall reports",
          "sentence": "As of Oct. 8, Pacearth Direct was aware of at least 30 reports of falls, resulting in nine injuries, including fractures, head injuries and bruising, the recall report states.",
